  "body": "Part of #290 (design decisions D1-D10 in its research comment).\n\nDepends on: #536.\n\nUpper and lower profiles given separately, paired into moves whose pose spans from the lower point to the paired upper point (D2). The pairing rule (by arc length, or user sync points) is explicit and stated in the op. Crossing or folding pairings (consecutive rulings intersecting within the part height) are refused.\n\n**Done means:** a square-to-round transition posts and verifies, and a deliberately crossed sync point is refused by name. Pinned by motion and verify tests.",
